        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your body proves that shadow can't exist without light. Perhaps your eyes glow brighter or your veins occasionally pulse with light. You emit dim light within 5 feet of you. You can activate or suppress this ability with a Sustain action. Additionally, you can force fragments of your shadow to glow and even partially solidify, allowing you to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Light] and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Shield] as occult innate cantrips. Cantrips are heightened to a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up.</p>"
